1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,609
Same rent. Same job. 54 years apart.

2
00:00:03,550 --> 00:00:05,066
Watch the second pile.

3
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:09,759
April 1970. Median rent: $108.

4
00:00:09,750 --> 00:00:12,290
Minimum wage: $1.60 an hour.

5
00:00:12,350 --> 00:00:15,317
Rent cost 67.5 hours of work.

6
00:00:15,450 --> 00:00:17,273
Under half a month on the job.

7
00:00:17,750 --> 00:00:20,772
Today, median rent is $1,487.

8
00:00:20,750 --> 00:00:23,469
Minimum wage: still $7.25.

9
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:25,372
205 hours.

10
00:00:27,150 --> 00:00:28,970
More than a full month of work.

11
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:31,802
Before food. Before anything else.

